51	\caption{Per-condition standardized $\hat{\beta}$ with 95\% CI for $\eta_{\max}$ (left) and $K_{\mathrm{eff}}$ (right) at $K{=}3$ (wild cluster bootstrap).}
52	\label{fig:forest_plot}
